  "customfield_10154": null,
  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently the Link header with rel=\"type\" in fcrepo only includes LDP and Memento types. It would be helpful to clients if the header included rdf:type values so that they could detect locally meaningful resource types, such as pcdm:Object, etc.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This would allow for more efficient decision making based off the results of a lightweight HEAD request rather than needing to retrieve the entire RDF body for the resource.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The desired functionality is as follows.  In addition to mandatory link rel=type headers required by the fedora specifications (LDP, memento, etc):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "On LDP-RS (RDFSource) resources, Fedora shall expose link rel=type headers for all non-server-managed rdf:type triples found in its body whose subject is the LDP-RS",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "On LDP-NR (NonRDFSource) resources, Fedora shall expose Link rel=type headers for all non-server-managed rdf:type triples found in the body of its descriptive LDP-RS whose subject is the LDP-NR",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      },
      {
       "content": [
        {
         "content": [
          {
           "text": "On LDP-RS resources that describe an LDP-NR, Fedora shall expose Link rel=type headers for all non-server-managed rdf:type triples found in its body whose subject is either the LDP-RS, or the described LDP-NR",
           "type": "text"
          }
         ],
         "type": "paragraph"
        }
       ],
       "type": "listItem"
      }
     ],
     "type": "bulletList"
    }
   ],
